VITE_APP_TITLE=チョコスケ

# Environment-specific values go in .env.local (gitignored), never here: this file is public.
# Every one may be unset; the app still runs (root AGENTS.md "Public config values for the frontend").
#
# VITE_GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID: Google OAuth web client id. Also set it on the backend
#   (`wrangler secret put GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID`). Unset: no Google button (the development login in dev).
# VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY: VAPID public key (base64url) for push notifications. The backend needs the
#   same key pair (`VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY`, `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY`, `VAPID_SUBJECT` secrets).
# VITE_OPERATOR_NAME / VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL: 利用規約・プライバシーポリシー（src/legal/documents.ts）に表示する運営者名と
#   問い合わせ先。デプロイ前に .env.local で設定する。未設定のときは仮の表示になる。
